sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Middleware as Command middleware
    participant Command as Outermost command
    participant Nested as Nested command, or notification handler
    participant Store as Store
    participant DB as Database

    Middleware->>Middleware: begin the unit: nothing is sent yet
    Middleware->>+Command: run
    Command->>+Store: read
    Store-->>-Command: rows, outside any transaction
    Note over Command: calls of another service belong here, before the first write
    Command->>+Nested: run, through the command middleware, which joins
    Nested->>+Store: write
    Store->>+DB: the first write opens the transaction
    DB-->>-Store: done
    Store-->>-Nested: done
    Nested-->>-Command: result
    Command->>+Store: write
    Store->>+DB: in the same transaction
    DB-->>-Store: done, or a failure
    Store-->>-Command: done, or the outcome
    Command-->>-Middleware: result, or an error
    alt the command returned
        Middleware->>DB: commit
    else the command threw
        Middleware->>DB: rollback
    end
